# Netlist gate: every bit of the struct the void function fills must have a
# driver.  Without the fix the member write inside the if/else arms is dropped
# (the arm is walked by the ordinary comb path, where the formal is no module
# wire) and `check` reports the `undefined` bit as undriven.
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top tf_formal_member_write_in_branch
proc; opt_clean
check -assert
